  '68K': _describe(
    'Medical laboratory specialists run the tests a diagnosis rests on: blood banking, hematology, chemistry, serology, bacteriology and urinalysis, including drawing the blood samples. The skill level one course is conducted under the U.S. Army Medical Center of Excellence.',
