  '68R': _describe(
    'Veterinary food inspection specialists inspect the meat, poultry, seafood, dairy, eggs, rations and produce troops eat, sampling and grading them in depots, supply points and on installations. Their course runs under the U.S. Army Medical Center of Excellence.',
